# Master spec (ecosystem)

**MANDATORY for all dryl.io work (not optional):** 

For stack, @dryl/ui, **UI lint scripts** (`bootstrap:ui-lint`, spacing/typography/BEM/lines), deploy, bootstrap for *new pages/sites* (e.g. health.dryl.io — you MUST run `cd directory && npm run bootstrap:dryl-app`), auth patterns, and maintenance, read:

**`Repos/speculation/master-spec.md`**

**ALWAYS** use the Read tool on that path (relative to Repos/ as sibling) at the *start* of any relevant task. Do not skip because "it was mentioned before", do not treat the "unless Daryl overrides in chat" as a general excuse to bypass bootstrap or centralized processes. Bypassing (e.g. manually writing health.html instead of using bootstrap) leads to the wrong thing and wastes time.

Do not @-mention or paste the entire file. `speculation/AGENTS.md` is the short index.

**Mindset + finish line:** `speculation/.cursor/rules/ecosystem-health.mdc` (single source of truth for how agents work — survival instinct, deploy handoff). Per-repo `debugging.md` is for failed experiments only.

When the workspace is a single app repo, still use that path relative to `Repos/` (sibling of the app).
